{"type":"message","id":"cfe98238","parentId":"a4bf9a36","timestamp":"2026-05-30T02:45:03.622Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-a…-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Saturday, May 30th, 2026 - 2:45 AM (UTC)\nReference UTC: 2026-05-30 02:45 UTC"}],"timestamp":1780109103587}}
{"type":"message","id":"e72fd660","parentId":"cfe98238","timestamp":"2026-05-30T02:45:08.501Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform for messages in two threads: arbitration and general. I need to fetch history from both threads, check for new messages (not from me), and respond if there are new discussions.\n\nLet me fetch both threads simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"db5c66e702e0095534a89caf805a87e75d8c3f5f7a5999086f5d6a93ab42f1dd"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kkob1oirul3c_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_kkob1oirul3c_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-a…-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":13711,"output":180,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13891,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780109103647,"responseId":"06698230b72a61db9c486e73d0de6e24"}}
