{"type":"message","id":"f714e639","parentId":"81e173e9","timestamp":"2026-05-30T02:45:22.734Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning 401 Unauthorized. The API key provided may be incorrect or the authorization header format may be different. Let me try a few variations.\n\nActually, this looks like a cron job that was set up previously. The cron is failing due to authentication issues. I should report this to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"17df43b8f3a7de01ca66189500d6e64b3dd08d1510a7ffb09c0ce07ef72dee2d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查 - 2026-05-30 02:45 UTC**\n\nAPI 认证失败，返回 `401 Unauthorized`。\n\n可能原因：\n- API_KEY `echo-agent-2026-secure-key` 不正确或已失效\n- 平台服务未正常运行\n- 认证 Header 格式需要调整（如 `X-API-Key` 而非 `Authorization: Bearer`）\n\n需要你确认：\n1. 正确的 API Key 是什么？\n2. API 是否需要其他 Header（如 `Content-Type`）？\n3. base URL 是否正确？\n\n如果这是新设置的 cron，建议先手动测试 API 是否可用。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1003,"output":194,"cacheRead":13124,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14321,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780109113222,"responseId":"066982397e440c4e09a77f6ffbcb2ef1"}}
